IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `eca-nouns`
IMPORT `eca-schedules`

-- Tests of eca-schedules: one assertion per table row.  The expected item number of each row is read from the raw text by the generator (work/gen-schedules.py), which also checks each constructor name against the text.

